{
  "bodyHash": "e7c6c87fb130a901",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"Serilum 合集包。用心制作。将 Serilum 的模组整合在一起，方便下载！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg\" alt=\"关于合集包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>自定义合集包（Customization Bundle）</strong>是一种特殊的模组类型，它将 Serilum 的多个<strong>自定义类</strong>模组整合到了一个模组中。虽然我将自己的模组归类非常困难，但我尝试这样做是为了让安装变得更加容易。它使用了一种称为 JiJ（Jar in Jar，即“Jar 中的 Jar”）的系统。这意味着包含在内的模组保持完全独立，同时允许像模组包一样捆绑安装。所有模组仍然拥有各自的配置文件，并且你会在游戏中看到它们全部列在模组列表中。<br><br>该合集包是模组包开发的额外辅助工具，但并不能替代我个人偏好的模块化模组系统。不过，可以通过合集包的配置文件禁用其中包含的模组。<strong>更改配置后需要重启游戏才能生效。</strong><br><br>由于 JiJ 系统的工作方式，它与正常安装该模组以及同时安装合集包中包含的独立模组都兼容。这主要用于强制使用特定版本，但如果不小心以这种方式重复安装了模组，也不会造成问题。虽然这可能不是大问题，但最好只安装一次。因此，如果你决定安装此合集包，可以移除其他属于此合集包的模组。<br><br>我希望这个合集包对喜欢内容更丰富的模组的你们有所帮助。非常感谢多年来大家的支持！<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"环境：客户端与服务器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableAlteredDamage</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableAlternativeWorldSaveLocation</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBiomeSpawnPoint</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableConfigurableDespawnTimer</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableConfigurableExtraMobDrops</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableConfigurableFurnaceBurnTime</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableConfigurableMobPotionEffects</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCustomCredits</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCycleTitleScreenSplash</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableDifficultyLock</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableFirstJoinMessage</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableHideExperimentalWarning</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSaveandLoadInventories</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSetWorldSpawnPoint</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSimpleMenu</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableStarterKit</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableStarterStructure</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span></div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg\" alt=\"可用合集包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下 Serilum 模组合集包可供选择：</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006994\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 客户端合集包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#999\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 自定义合集包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#804d4f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 扩展合集包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#bf8f6f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 体验优化合集包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006b3f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum RPG 合集包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#805a46\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 出生点合集包</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg\" alt=\"包含的模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/altered-damage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/altered-damage.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/altered-damage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Altered Damage</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使用修正值改变玩家和其他实体受到伤害及造成伤害。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alternative-world-save-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/alternative-world-save-location.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alternative-world-save-location\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alternative World Save Location</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许将 Minecraft 世界的默认存档文件路径更改到实例范围之外。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biome-spawn-point\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/biome-spawn-point.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biome-spawn-point\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biome Spawn Point</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许指定在新世界创建时玩家将在哪个生物群系中生成。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configurable-despawn-timer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/configurable-despawn-timer.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configurable-despawn-timer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable Despawn Timer</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许物品和经验球在地面上停留更长时间、更短或无限期存在。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configurable-extra-mob-drops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/configurable-extra-mob-drops.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configurable-extra-mob-drops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable Extra Mob Drops</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">通过命令和配置文件为实体添加任何额外的物品掉落，支持掉落几率。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configurable-furnace-burn-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/configurable-furnace-burn-time.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configurable-furnace-burn-time\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable Furnace Burn Time</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许通过配置修正值全局更改熔炉中的燃料燃烧时间。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configurable-mob-potion-effects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/configurable-mob-potion-effects.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configurable-mob-potion-effects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable Mob Potion Effects</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">设置所有生物永久拥有并施加的药水效果。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-credits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/custom-credits.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-credits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Custom Credits</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许更改制作人员名单屏幕的内容和行为，包括终末诗。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cycle-title-screen-splash\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/cycle-title-screen-splash.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cycle-title-screen-splash\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cycle Title Screen Splash</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">主菜单上的标语文本会在可配置的延迟后不断更改。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/difficulty-lock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/difficulty-lock.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/difficulty-lock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Difficulty Lock</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在任何世界中设置难度，可选择锁定，或强制要求硬核模式。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/first-join-message\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/first-join-message.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/first-join-message\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">First Join Message</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">向首次加入世界的玩家发送可配置的消息。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hide-experimental-warning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/hide-experimental-warning.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hide-experimental-warning\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hide Experimental Warning</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在尝试创建或加载模组世界时隐藏实验性设置警告。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/save-and-load-inventories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/save-and-load-inventories.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/save-and-load-inventories\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Save and Load Inventories</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">通过使用命令保存和加载玩家库存或套装给自身或其他人。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/set-world-spawn-point\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/set-world-spawn-point.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/set-world-spawn-point\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Set World Spawn Point</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许为（新创建的）世界设置精确的自定义出生点，并进行出生点调整。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-menu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/simple-menu.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-menu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simple Menu</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">为主菜单添加一些基本功能，以编辑 Minecraft 主菜单的样式和按钮，更改窗口标题并设置新图标。一个较 FancyMenu 更简洁的替代方案。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/starter-kit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/starter-kit.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/starter-kit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Starter Kit</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">给予所有新加入世界的玩家可配置的初始装备、物品和/或药水效果。它可以覆盖初始库存，或在之后添加物品。兼容 FTB Team Islands。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/starter-structure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/starter-structure.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/starter-structure\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Starter Structure</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允许通过结构文件在世界初始生成的出生点处创建建筑物。</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载内容保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统内托管，您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此捆绑包。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在众多独立的模组页面之间跟踪评论，因此已禁用评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或任何其他事项，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
